<h2>The meeting is close. Every response matters.</h2>
<p>There are different views on the best way forward: a full HV replacement, a fair buy-back, fair compensation, or other concerns. Every response helps us understand where owners agree and where the discussion needs more work. This is about giving those experiences a clearer voice at the meeting.</p>
<p>You can select every outcome you would support and, if you wish, mark an eligible option as your preferred outcome. Sign in with your member email to take part. Results stay hidden until you submit, so your answer is your own. You can edit your response while the survey remains open.</p>

<h2>Your vehicle history adds weight</h2>
<p>At publication, {{ surveyReminder.members }} owners had joined and recorded {{ surveyReminder.vehicles }} cars, {{ surveyReminder.soh }} battery-health readings and {{ surveyReminder.service }} service and fault records. Those histories help explain what recalls, repeated repairs and long waits for parts mean in practice.</p>
<p>If you have a missing service visit, a fault, a repair or a battery-health reading to add, now is a useful time to record it.</p>
<p><a class="btn btn--secondary survey-reminder-pill" href="/member/dashboard/">Add my vehicle history</a></p>

